  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the wildcard treats the fateseal class feature as though it were always active. He may suppress or resume fateseal’s effects as a standard action.</p>\n<p>In addition, you may have up to two portents placed face up in front of you with the dealt fate class feature without reducing the wildcard’s maximum hand size. If you ever have three or more portents placed face up in front of you in this manner, the wildcard’s maximum hand size is reduced as normal.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wildcard#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
